0008: user namespaces are a real, runtime-controlled capability.  Restores the
upstream current_chrooted() check (replacing the retired unconditional EPERM),
keeps the CONFIG_LOD_SEC uid gate, and adds kernel.unprivileged_userns_clone
(default 0) so services/nuxel-firewall opts in when confinement is installed.
Enforced by tools/s10plus/verify-kernel-userns.py in build-kernel.sh.
